{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD & Ally Lotti]\n[00:00.02]Vibe on this bitch, though (Do you have a lighter?)\n[00:01.84]A lighter?\n[00:03.64]Not in the room\n[00:06.00]Oh\n[00:10.84]Uh-huh\n[Verse 1]\n[00:12.30]You work numbers, work wonders\n[00:15.70]You done woke me up from my eternal slumber\n[00:18.92]I'm the lightning, you’re the thunder\n[00:22.08]There's a difference 'tween \"I need you\" and \"I want you\"\n[00:24.46]Girl, I need you\n[00:25.26]Good sex led to conversations getting a little deeper, uh\n[00:28.84]Tell me your darkest secrets, shit you wouldn’t even tell Jesus, uh\n[00:32.06]My karma been tweaking so much, I don't even believe in karma\n[00:35.16]But you give me a reason to thank God for all these recent falls\n[00:38.88]Percocet 30, E 8, I've been gettin' off\n[00:42.24]I done chilled out on the drugs since you've been involved\n[00:45.26]Suck it like it's law (Uh), fuck me like it's law (Uh-huh)\n[00:48.22]No protection on my heart, goddamnit, I'm gon’ hit it raw\n[00:51.64]Traumatized from my past, yeah, I keep a log\n[00:54.92]In my mind, in my head, where that shit belong\n[00:58.06]They say you after my bread, shit, I hope they wrong\n[01:00.92]You already ran up the bands, we could have a ball\n[01:04.48]Hit it from the back, humina, call a play, huddle up\n[01:07.68]This that good love in the bedroom\n[01:10.86]Fuck you in the Prada, poker face like Lady Gaga\n[01:14.08]Ride it like a Mazda, zoom, zoom, zoom\n[Chorus]\n[01:17.52]I’m all, I'm really all in\n[01:20.72]In love with all your flaws and sins\n[01:23.88]Your scars are really gorgeous\n[01:27.14]Ain’t that a weird way to give compliments?\n[01:30.38]I'm all, I'm really all in\n[01:32.58]I fell in love with all your flaws and sins\n[01:36.88]Your scars are really gorgeous\n[01:39.64]I see your light in all the darkness\n[Verse 2]\n[01:42.82]Woah\n[01:43.74]Atta boy, I done turned to a man\n[01:46.86]Hot chills when my skin is on your skin\n[01:50.08]Hope you know that if you ever try to end\n[01:53.30]You gon' catch a couple out the F&N\n[01:56.10]That mean Cupid ain’t give you a headshot\n[01:58.86]So I ain't got no choice but to leave you with a headshot (Bloaw)\n[02:02.50]Look at the way I make that fucking bed rock, uh\n[02:05.26]Where your ring finger at? I need wedlock\n[02:08.46]Got my sights on your ass, ooh, red dot\n[02:11.28]We some bats that made it out of Hell, ooh, red hot\n[02:56.90]Don't, ayy, go all night, bitch, don't stop\n[03:27.24]We ain't even gon' be finished 'til the sun's up\n[Chorus]\n[04:08.70]I'm all, I'm really all in\n[04:19.92]In love with all your flaws and sins\n[04:23.08]Your scars are really gorgeous\n[04:45.76]Ain't that a weird way of giving compliments?\n[05:16.30]I'm all, I'm really all in\n[05:43.12]In love with all your flaws and sins\n[06:17.48]Your scars are really gorgeous\n[07:08.06]That's my way of giving compliments\n[07:20.52]I'm all, I'm really all in\n[07:41.56]In love with all your flaws and sins\n[08:02.84]Your scars are really gorgeous\n[08:15.58]Ain't that a weird way to give compliments?\n[08:45.52]I'm all, I'm really all in\n[08:52.60]I fell in love with all your flaws and sins\n[09:04.94]Your scars are really gorgeous\n[09:07.66]I see light in all the darkness","words":[[0.02,0.12,"Vibe"],[0.2,0.22,"on"],[0.26,0.32,"this"],[0.36,0.46,"bitch,"],[0.5,0.62,"though"],[0.68,0.76,"(Do"],[0.8,0.84,"you"],[0.88,0.94,"have"],[0.98,0.98,"a"],[1.02,1.72,"lighter?)"],[1.84,1.84,"A"],[2.34,2.66,"lighter?"],[3.64,3.96,"Not"],[4.0,4.06,"in"],[4.1,4.14,"the"],[4.2,4.44,"room"],[6.0,6.1,"Oh"],[10.84,10.98,"Uh-huh"],[12.3,12.36,"You"],[12.48,12.76,"work"],[12.88,13.64,"numbers,"],[14.08,14.34,"work"],[14.5,15.26,"wonders"],[15.7,15.76,"You"],[15.86,16.04,"done"],[16.08,16.22,"woke"],[16.26,16.34,"me"],[16.46,16.5,"up"],[16.66,16.82,"from"],[16.88,16.98,"my"],[17.12,17.54,"eternal"],[17.62,18.28,"slumber"],[18.92,19.04,"I'm"],[19.08,19.12,"the"],[19.24,19.9,"lightning,"],[20.48,20.62,"you’re"],[20.66,